>\n<li>右子节点的值将 等于 父节点的值。</li>\n</ul>\n","question_options":[{"text":"正确","text_html":"<p>正确</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"错误","text_html":"<p>错误</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":93,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"下图的树是二叉搜索树吗？\n\n![](/content/assets/93521affe18b11945498.png)","question_text_html":"<p>下图的树是二叉搜索树吗？</p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/assets/93521affe18b11945498.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"正确","text_html":"<p>正确</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"错误","text_html":"<p>错误</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":94,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下代码的平均时间复杂度是多少？\n\n```python\ndef search(self, find_val):\n  return self.search_helper(self.root, find_val)\n\ndef search_helper(self, current, find_val):\n  if current:\n    if current.data == find_val:\n        return True\n    elif current.data < find_val:\n        return self.search_helper(current.right, find_val)\n    else:\n        return self.search_helper(current.left, find_val)\n```","question_text_html":"<p>以下代码的平均时间复杂度是多少？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">def search(self, find_val):\n  return self.search_helper(self.root, find_val)\n\ndef search_helper(self, current, find_val):\n  if current:\n    if current.data == find_val:\n        return True\n    elif current.data &lt; find_val:\n        return self.search_helper(current.right, find_val)\n    else:\n        return self.search_helper(current.left, find_val)\n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"text":"$O(n/2)$\n","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n/2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"$O(log n)$\n","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"$O(n)$\n","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mope